Update the client application so that it serves a static webpage.

The page should contain a table that consists of two columns: Action and Result.
The table should have three rows with a button in the "Action" column. The three
rows should have different button names "Authorized", "Unauthorized" and
"Unknown".

When each button is clicked it should call a REST resource with the same path as
the button name, but the path should be all lowercase on the server-side. When
executed, each resource should return a String that is then displayed
on the frontend webpage.

Add the necessary quarkus extension, web pages and server resources in order for
this to work as described.
